  // Technique items (M2′ acquisition v1). Each teaches one move from the universal library
  // into the character's learned list — moves are never Base-exclusive (DECISIONS D25).
  // Droppable/purchasable sources arrive with loot tables (M6); today the debug grant button
  // and future realm rewards are the faucet. Convention: Manual = martial/utility technique,
  // Grimoire = spell.

  // ---- The three exemplars ----------------------------------------------------------------
